pbt-data

The data this repository builds and publishes at https://pbt-data.xaroth.nl/ is derived from the
game files of Path of Exile. Path of Exile and its game data are the property of Grinding Gear
Games. The published data holds derived values only (stat ids, numbers, names and text), for
non-commercial use, and the passive tree sprite sheets Grinding Gear Games publishes in
https://github.com/grindinggear/skilltree-export, unchanged; no other art, audio or game files.
The data is not licensed by the maintainers of this repository.

This product isn't affiliated with or endorsed by Grinding Gear Games in any way.

Rights holders who want data removed: open an issue at https://github.com/xaroth/pbt-data/issues
or contact the repository owner through GitHub. Requests are handled promptly.
